            "source:fe3eb30ccfdf2cd073498a9a"
          ],
          "text": "Fallenroot Hellcallers are hostile inhabitants of Blackfathom Deeps. They use the same taunts as the Shadowstalkers, boasting of safety and threatening mutilation and trophies from their victims. In combat, Hellcallers cast Shadow Bolt.",
          "when": {
