          ],
          "text": "Twilight Lord Kelris leads the Twilight’s Hammer cultists in Blackfathom Deeps. The Blackfathom Villainy account says they ally with naga and sacrifice innocents to Aku’Mai for power. Kelris resents intruders disturbing his meditation and addresses opponents with a terse command to sleep.",
